type: software
title: "sori-metrics"
abstract: >-
  Objective audio quality metrics in pure Rust: the 2f model (on an ITU-R BS.1387 Basic ear
  model), a ViSQOL v3 audio-mode compatible MOS for music, Total NMR, and BSS Eval v4 / SI-SDR
  scores for music source separation.
